        <mxCell id="gap3c" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#A34D26;strokeWidth=3" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="492" y="276" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="466" y="302" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="gaplbl" value="These two carry the certificate.&#10;An agent + RAG build has no edge to them." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=center;fontSize=11;fontColor=#A34D26" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="360" y="222" width="240" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

        <mxCell id="fix" value="THE FIX — carve out the situation router as a supervised text classifier&#10;&#10;Baseline: TF-IDF + logistic regression.  Then gradient boosting, then a fine-tuned transformer, then an LLM zero-shot arm as a fourth comparison.&#10;EDA on the labelled corpus: class imbalance, message length, vocabulary per situation.  Error analysis on the confusion matrix.&#10;That satisfies rows 2 and 3 honestly, and the trained model drops straight into the &quot;Situation router&quot; box on page 1." style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=10;fillColor=#D6E8E5;strokeColor=#0D6A60;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;fontColor=#161D1A" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="540" width="880" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

        <mxCell id="blockers" value="BLOCKERS ON THAT FIX — none of these are solved&#10;&#10;1.  The labelled corpus does not exist.  focus.md prescribes 20 forum posts; a classifier needs hundreds, with agreed labels.&#10;2.  Forum posts are personal narratives of identifiable people.  The brief requires anonymised, no-PII data on a public GitHub repo.&#10;3.  There is no client.  G4 closes 2026-10-15 and zero of the 20 providers have replied, so &quot;my client's input&quot; is not yet a data source.&#10;4.  It is group work, 2 to 5 people, mid-term at week 2.  Three teammates have to want to spend four weeks on German relocation providers." style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=10;fillColor=#F2DFD5;strokeColor=#A34D26;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;fontColor=#161D1A" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="675" width="880" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
